  // How the buildings look (presentation only; Rendering/BuildingKit.cs, docs/ART.md "Building
  // kits"). Wall models are made for a wall running along X through the cell (y 0.5 is its
  // middle) and turned as needed: "span" a straight run, "arm" half a wall from the middle to +X
  // (one towards each neighbour where walls meet or end, round a "corner" post), "post" a P cell,
  // "door" the frame round a door. The roof is pitched over the plot, the ridge along its long side.
  "kits": [
    {
